WEBVTT

00:00:02.286 --> 00:00:07.416
- Hagrid, what exactly is that?
- That? It's...

00:00:07.624 --> 00:00:09.626
I know what that is!

00:00:09.877 --> 00:00:12.504
But, Hagrid, how did you get one?

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.133
I won it. Off a stranger
I met down at the pub.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.429
Seemed quite glad to be rid of it,
as a matter of fact.

00:00:45.662 --> 00:00:46.830
A dragon?

00:00:47.039 --> 00:00:51.460
That's not just a dragon.
That's a Norwegian ridgeback.

00:00:51.668 --> 00:00:54.546
My brother works
with these in Romania.

00:00:54.755 --> 00:00:59.635
Isn't he beautiful? Oh, bless him.
Look, he knows his mummy.

00:01:00.302 --> 00:01:02.054
Hello, norbert.

00:01:02.346 --> 00:01:06.683
- Norbert?
- He's gotta have a name, don't he?

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.853
Don't you, norbert?

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.988
He'll have to be trained up a bit,
of course.

00:01:23.867 --> 00:01:25.953
Who's that?

00:01:27.663 --> 00:01:29.706
Malfoy.

00:01:30.499 --> 00:01:31.875
Oh, dear.

00:01:33.627 --> 00:01:38.382
Harry: Hagrid always wanted a dragon.
Told me so the first time I met him.

00:01:38.632 --> 00:01:42.678
Ron: It's crazy.
And worse, Malfoy knows.

00:01:42.886 --> 00:01:46.974
- Harry: I don't understand. Is that bad?
- It's bad.

00:01:47.224 --> 00:01:49.393
Good evening.

00:01:53.063 --> 00:01:55.983
Nothing, I repeat, nothing...

00:01:56.233 --> 00:01:59.736
Gives a student the right
to walk about at night.

00:01:59.903 --> 00:02:04.825
Therefore, as punishment for your
actions, 50 points will be taken.

00:02:08.412 --> 00:02:10.747
To ensure it doesn't happen again...

00:02:10.998 --> 00:02:14.334
All four of you
will receive detention.

00:02:15.252 --> 00:02:18.213
Excuse me, professor,
perhaps I heard you wrong.

00:02:18.422 --> 00:02:20.757
I thought you said the four of us.

00:02:20.924 --> 00:02:23.427
No, you heard me correctly.

00:02:23.677 --> 00:02:28.682
Honorable as your intentions were,
you too were out of bed after hours.

00:02:29.141 --> 00:02:32.102
You will join your classmates
in detention.

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:47.284
Filch: A pity they let
the old punishments die.

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:52.247
Was a time detention found you
hanging by your thumbs in the dungeons.

00:02:52.456 --> 00:02:55.292
God, I miss the screaming.

